            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Rat experiments were made to study effects of magnetic fields varying in parameters on the course of endotoxemia and relevant changes. Dynamics of temperature and pain reactions, some biochemical indices depends much on frequency and impulse characteristics of low-frequency magnetic field.</AbstractText>
